       T0302 Procalcitonin
       A TITLE    Procalcitonin
       A G        G
       A PCT1     PCT1
       A PCT2     PCT2
       A PCT3     PCT3
       A PCT4     PCT4
       A PCT5     PCT5
       * Example Comment
       I          WBHMIC
       I          NORMALX
       I          HL7NUMX  AV2      Y        Y
       I          GOTO,LE  PCT1     VALUE    0.50
       I          GOTO,LE  PCT2     VALUE    2.00
       I          GOTO,LT  PCT3     VALUE    10.00
       I          GOTO,M   PCT4     TYPE     G
       I          GOTO,EQ  PCT3     VALUE    10.00
       I          GOTO,GT  PCT4     VALUE    10.00
       I          GOTO     FIN
       I PCT1     COMMENT  PCT1
       I          GOTO     FIN
       I PCT2     COMMENT  PCT2
       I          GOTO     FIN
       I PCT3     COMMENT  PCT3
       I          GOTO     FIN
       I PCT4     COMMENT  PCT4
       I FIN      COMMENT  PCT5
       I END
